  "description": "Community (free) edition of sgcMaps for .NET: maps model, tile math, geometry, map items, providers, tile sources (folder, HTTP) and GeoJSON / GPX / KML import and export, with no functional limits. Free for both commercial and non-commercial use by small teams (individuals and organizations under EUR 1M annual gross revenue and no more than 5 developers); organizations at or above either threshold need a Commercial licence. The offline pack (tile downloader, MBTiles tile source, esegece.sgcMaps.Offline) is not included in the Community edition. https://www.esegece.com",
